--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party material bundled with this package
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

None. This package contains no schema, no table, no corpus and no vendored
text of any kind — it is a reader with no dependencies, and the only files it
ships besides its own source are this notice and the licence beside it.

The material the sibling distribution `vdi2770-validate` bundles — VDI's XML
schema, the IDTA document class table, the reference implementation's corpus —
is accounted for in that distribution's own NOTICE and THIRD_PARTY.md, and none
of it is here. The two are released together under one version, so the notices
that apply to a machine holding both are that pair read side by side.

The text of the VDI 2770 guideline itself (VDI 2770 Blatt 1:2020-04) is sold by
DIN Media and is NOT included, quoted, or paraphrased anywhere in this project.
